Feature: About page
  As a visitor
  I want to read the about page
  So that I understand what this site is for

  Scenario: About page loads and is generated by Astro
    Given I am on "/about/"
    Then I should be on "/about/"
    And the page should be generated by Astro
    And I should see "About this demo"
    And the page title should end with "| Astro Steps Demo"

  Scenario: About page links back to the home page
    Given I am on "/about/"
    Then the "Back to home" link should contain "/"
    When I click "Back to home"
    And I wait until the page is loaded
    Then I should be on the homepage
